    {
      "bbox": [
        675,
        2111,
        1794,
        2813
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"Whereas, the Army and Navy Union of the United States of America, United Spanish War Veterans, Veterans of Foreign Wars of the United States, American Legion, Disabled American Veterans of the World War, Army and Navy Legion of Valor of the United States, Jewish War Veterans of the United States, Military Order of the Purple Heart, Catholic War Veterans, Italian War Veterans, and other veteran organizations will hold their several State and National conventions and encampments during the summer and fall of the year 1946; therefore, be it",
